msgid "- Check share permissions (read/write)\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Angalia ruhusa za kushiriki (soma/andika)\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Ensure NAS is powered on and accessible\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Hakikisha NAS imewashwa na inapatikana\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Enter server IP, share name, username and password\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Ingiza IP ya seva, shiriki jina, jina la mtumiaji na nenosiri\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Go to Main Menu > Setup > System > Storage Manager\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Nenda kwenye Menyu Kuu > Mipangilio > Mfumo > Kidhibiti cha Hifadhi\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- HDD backups: Stored in /media/hdd/backup\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Hifadhi rudufu za HDD: Imehifadhiwa katika /media/hdd/chelezo\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Keep regular backups of your system\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Weka nakala rudufu za mara kwa mara za mfumo wako\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- NET backups: Require mounted CIFS/NFS share with write permissions\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Hifadhi rudufu za NET: Inahitaji ushiriki uliowekwa wa CIFS/NFS na ruhusa za uandishi\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Never interrupt backup/restore processes\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Usikatishe kamwe michakato ya kuhifadhi/rejesha\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Restore: Works from HDD, USB, NET or MMC storage\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Rejesha: Hufanya kazi kutoka kwa HDD, USB, NET au hifadhi ya MMC\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Select 'Network Storage' and add your NAS/SMB share\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Chagua 'Hifadhi ya Mtandao' na uongeze sehemu yako ya NAS/SMB\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Test connection with ping command\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Jaribu muunganisho kwa amri ya ping\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- USB backups: Require FAT32-formatted drive with 'backupstick' file\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Hifadhi rudufu za USB: Inahitaji hifadhi iliyoumbizwa FAT32 yenye faili ya 'chelezo'\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Use quality USB drives for recovery sticks\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Tumia hifadhi za USB za ubora kwa vijiti vya urejeshaji\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Verify username/password are correct\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Thibitisha jina la mtumiaji/nenosiri ni sahihi\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "- Verify you have enough free storage space\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "- Thibitisha kuwa una nafasi ya kutosha ya hifadhi isiyolipishwa\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "1. Mount your network share first:\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "1. Weka sehemu ya mtandao wako kwanza:\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "2. Select 'NET Backup' from the device list\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "2. Chagua 'Nakala ya NET' kutoka kwenye orodha ya vifaa\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "3. Choose your mounted network share\\\\\\\\n"
msgstr "3. Chagua ushiriki wako wa mtandao uliopachikwa\\\\\\\\n"

msgid "A recording is currently running. Please stop the recording before trying to start a flashing."
msgstr "Rekodi inaendeshwa kwa sasa. Tafadhali sitisha kurekodi kabla ya kujaribu kuanza kuwaka."

